{"type":"text","timestamp":1790409185525,"sessionID":"ses_f235274fdffeAZ3hfwK6AeCtz1","part":{"id":"prt_0dcb418e7001Bh2PlagXs6Vt0i","messageID":"msg_0dcb36ec0001zttzF9a31RueNi","sessionID":"ses_f235274fdffeAZ3hfwK6AeCtz1","type":"text","text":"All done. Here's a summary of what was changed:\n\n**`scripts/player_body.gd`** — Full camera shake system implemented:\n- Added `camera_shake_noise: FastNoiseLite` export plus all numeric exports (`noise_panning_speed=30`, `max_power=0.15`, `blend_speed=7`, `return_strength=5`, `noise_strength=0.2`, `falling_bias=1.0`, `falling_strength_falloff=2.0`, `falling_max_strength=1.0`, `jumping_strength=0.2`)\n- `_physics_process`: samples 2D noise at different offsets for x/y/z, lerps `CameraActual.position` toward `camera_shake_position + noise`, decays `camera_shake_position` back to origin\n- `impulse_camera`: adds direction-scaled impulse, clamped to `max_power`\n- `impulse_camera_with_recoil`: calls `impulse_camera` with the base direction, then adds an upward kick using `jumping_strength`\n- `apply_landing_impulse`: when downward velocity exceeds `falling_bias`, computes a proportional downward impulse clamped to `falling_max_strength`\n\n**`scenes/player_body.tscn`** — Added `FastNoiseLite` sub-resource + wired `camera_shake_noise` export. Scene structure remains `CameraNode → CameraActual → Camera3D` (as it already was).","time":{"start":1790409185512,"end":1790409185513},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_737a88b2-bfdc-47c0-8a28-118f7a9d3119"}}}}
